For several months we have been happily playing Conquer 3.0 at patch
level 5, but now it has been consistantly coredumping on us.  

Our machine: AT&T 3B2/300 running System 5 Release 2.0 3B2 version (I know,
it's old).

I have seen two different errors: a Floating Point Exception and Bus Error.
The FP Exception normally occurs in navy battles where there are no men
left on a ship (combat.c navalcbt() where there is a division on dkcrew).

The bus error in other places, and I've found (with sdb), that the nation
number is always 32 (our nation max is the default 28).

I have backed off to no patches, and everything runs fine.  At patch level
2 admin again leaves it's carcas on the disk.

I don't find the code to exactly be a pleasure to work with, so I am
asking if anybody has encountered these problems and fixed them.  I can
post or mail sdb stack traces upon request.  I'm mainly curious about 
whether or not anybody else is in the same boat as us.

